# Governed semantic-layer definitions are NOT routed here. CODEOWNERS matches on
# file path, and a sem_*.yml holds the business rule, the events implementing it,
# the build and display prose in one file — so a path rule asked both review
# groups for a typo fix, and being asked to review something you have no say over
# is how people stop reading the requests.
#
# Routing is decided by which YAML keys moved, in the `routing` job of
# .github/workflows/semantic-layer-composition-check.yml. It is still advisory:
# it requests review, it does not block merge. See the semantic-layer SOP.
